| [src/hixl/engine/connect_pool_executor.cc](https://github.com/gitcode.com/cann/hixl/blob/a5dd1de0a30a0ebbe7e90b84fa9a9bb6c8929477/src/hixl/engine/connect_pool_executor.cc) | 核心实现：初始化/关闭、任务提交、工作线程主循环、状态防竞态规则 |
